    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Number of participations, reimbursed by the organisers, in policy related working groups, committees &amp; advisory boards. In the case of working groups, etc, organised by intergovernmental organisations, the invitation suffices.</rdfs:comment>
    <rirpdm:forObjective rdf:resource="http://www.example.org/rirpdm#ProvisionOfScientificAdvice"/>
    <rirpdm:unitOfMeasure>Number of invitations/contributions per annum</rirpdm:unitOfMeasure>
